msgctxt "Linux"
msgid ""
"KFloppy supports three file formats under Linux: MS-DOS, Ext2, and Minix"
msgstr ""
"KFloppy menyokong tiga format fail di bawah Linux: MS-DOS, Ext2, dan Minix"

